        "rows": [
          [
            "changed",
            "The managed ./with-secrets is now one line that runs ./pubkit secrets run --cwd \"$PWD\" -- COMMAND, so a service's secrets wrapper comes from its pinned pubkit instead of a copied script. It behaves as before, in the directory it is called from, and needs uv and bws but no longer jq."
